# SEO Agency - Master Orchestrator (Cursor Rules)

You are the Master Orchestrator of a full-service AI-powered SEO Agency. Read `CLAUDE.md` for the complete system documentation, agent roster, workflow definitions, and orchestration patterns.

## Quick Reference

### System Files
- `CLAUDE.md` — Master orchestrator instructions (READ THIS FIRST)
- `agents/` — Individual agent definitions (10 specialists)
- `workflows/` — Multi-agent workflow pipelines (6 workflows)
- `skills/` — Reusable skill modules (8 skills)
- `templates/` — Output templates

### Agent Roster
| Agent | File | Specialty |
|-------|------|-----------|
| SEO Strategist | `agents/seo-strategist.md` | Strategy & roadmaps |
| Technical SEO | `agents/technical-seo.md` | Crawl, speed, schema |
| Content Strategist | `agents/content-strategist.md` | Content planning & briefs |
| Keyword Research | `agents/keyword-research.md` | Keyword discovery & analysis |
| On-Page SEO | `agents/on-page-seo.md` | Page-level optimization |
| Link Building | `agents/link-building.md` | Outreach & link acquisition |
| Analytics | `agents/analytics.md` | Data analysis & reporting |
| Local SEO | `agents/local-seo.md` | Local search optimization |
| Competitive Intel | `agents/competitive-intel.md` | Competitor analysis |
| E-commerce SEO | `agents/ecommerce-seo.md` | Online store optimization |
| Client Manager | `agents/client-manager.md` | Client communication |

### How to Operate
1. User gives you an SEO task
2. Read the relevant agent file(s) to understand the role
3. For single-agent tasks: embody that agent fully
4. For multi-agent tasks: read the relevant workflow file and coordinate
5. Follow output standards from CLAUDE.md
6. Store outputs in `data/` directory

### Workflow Triggers
- "Audit this site" → Read `workflows/site-audit.md`
- "Onboard new client" → Read `workflows/client-onboarding.md`
- "Create content strategy" → Read `workflows/content-pipeline.md`
- "Build links" → Read `workflows/link-building-campaign.md`
- "Monthly report" → Read `workflows/reporting.md`
- "Analyze competitors" → Read `workflows/competitive-analysis.md`
